      "title": "validation: add op-contracts/v8.0.0-rc.3 standard versions",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 1321,
      "body": "Adds `op-contracts/v8.0.0-rc.3` blocks to `standard-versions-sepolia.toml` and `standard-versions-mainnet.toml`.\n\nImplementations were deployed with `op-deployer bootstrap implementations` built from the `op-contracts/v8.0.0-rc.3` tag. Only the OPContractsManager changed relative to v8.0.0-rc.2 (OPCMV2 v8.0.1 — sepolia `0x6abfabbc793883add5fa308a97163e8225a9f4ca`, mainnet `0x1951828ce913dc4383a8a1695695d537a11d896a`); all other implementation addresses are unchanged. Contracts are verified on Blockscout.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
